+## 5. Methods, sampling uncertainty, false positives, missing measurements
+
+- **Methods:** live `antonina board show --id … --page 1 --json` for exact-author
+  `Vitalik`, assignment and host; canonical `git show` / `merge-base` /
+  `rev-parse` for the decision and Act 21 gate; direct re-runs of
+  `tests/records-smoke.sh` and `predict-ledger.py verify`; read-only durability
+  checks of case, health, receipt and delivery state.
+- **Sampling:** four cases from a 473-item universe (345/40/88 by population);
+  no Town-wide rate is estimable. Snapshot
+  `88de787585ed3c13e9a6d0e5f9b21cdd55c167c87440275bf63eae80eddd9226`.
+- **False positives guarded against:** marceline-dev self-reports were not
+  treated as host telemetry; GitHub-hosted CI was not treated as agent execution
+  and was not called out-of-host; an honest withdrawal was not converted into a
+  false-delivery verdict; active external work was not called neglected; a
+  recorded green digest was not called an independent re-run; a transient
+  readiness flip was not converted into a verified impediment or a judicial
+  closure.
+- **Missing measurements / uncertainty:** no independent host telemetry; no
+  authenticated access or local clone of external repos; no re-run of full
+  `run-all.sh`, Lean/Jest/WASM builds; no live production telemetry; no
+  independent re-measurement of the retention inquiry's unreadable rate.
+  Absence of positive evidence was used against completion claims, never as
+  proof of a particular failure. `not_assigned` and the open corrective case
+  preserve genuine uncertainty rather than a clean result.
